  "details": "I noticed some issues with the new OSC Camera Endpoints in VRChat 2025.3.3 (OPEN BETA). Specifically:\n\nChanges to parameters of type float are not being notified.\n\nChanges to OrientationIsLandscape are not being notified.\n\nChanges to CameraEars are not being notified.\n\nFrom my testing, these parameters don’t seem to trigger any OSC notifications.",
